msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "521"
msgid "That'll be %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"The Iron Fist of Legend DVD's about some dude who\n"
"only fights with brass knuckles. I heard the star can\n"
"kick ass in real life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "663"
msgid ""
"The Musashi Motomiya Story is a true story about the\n"
"legendary swordsman himself. Motomiya enthusiasts\n"
"love this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "777"
msgid ""
"Wong Fei Sung Story, huh? Ever heard of Wong Fei\n"
"Sung? He's a kung fu master from ancient times, and\n"
"the DVD's about his life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Space Ninja V: Meteor Hell is the fifth Space Ninja\n"
"movie. You'll see a lot of fucked up weapons in this\n"
"DVD."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1014"
msgid ""
"The Yakuza Ambush DVD's a movie that shows some\n"
"dirty yakuza tricks in it. If you fight fair, this isn't for\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"The Hammer Place DVD is a surreal movie that I can't\n"
"figure out. Kind of a tear jerker, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1226"
msgid ""
"Taiko Tales has a dude traveling Japan with nothing\n"
"but a loincloth and two drumsticks. Try it out \n"
"yourself. You may be enlightned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1359"
msgid ""
"The Muscle Hustle II DVD's got a ripped action star\n"
"that makes the movie. It's a \"get-ripped-quick\"\n"
"collector's item."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1477"
msgid ""
"The High-Noon Limbo DVD is part limbo dancing,\n"
"part Western. I'd recommend it for a good laugh. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1574"
msgid ""
"The Prof. Savage II DVD's about a former tribal chief\n"
"who becomes a teacher, then goes postal. Typical\n"
"romantic comedy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1696"
msgid ""
"The Chicken Champs Collection is the complete DVD\n"
"set of the popular TV show. It's not airing anymore\n"
"so this one sells well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1822"
msgid ""
"Volatile Dragon is a spy flick starring a guy\n"
"codenamed Dragon. He uses all kinds of weird shit\n"
"for tools."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1929"
msgid ""
"This Kancho Master II DVD is the sequel to a popular\n"
"flick. They say the \"6-Finger Method\" is really\n"
"effective, but I don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2061"
msgid ""
"The Quiz Freaks DVD's got a collection of quiz shows\n"
"from TV. Not really popular nowadays..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2154"
msgid ""
"The Clothes Hanger Fun DVD's got some basic hanger\n"
"ideas in it. Pretty boring stuff if you ask me."
msgstr ""